<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Community Pharmacy & Health Services</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0056b3, #00a8cc);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: -30px auto 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .card h2 {
            color: #0056b3;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 22px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eef2f5;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .card h2 i {
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .service-box {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 18px;
            border-left: 4px solid #00a8cc;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .service-box h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #0056b3;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .contact-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 200px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-phone { background-color: #28a745; }
        .btn-email { background-color: #dc3545; }
        .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
        .btn i { margin-right: 10px; font-size: 18px; }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #002b5b;
            color: white;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1><i class="fa-solid fa-notes-medical"></i> Community Pharmacy & Health Services</h1>
        <p>Providing accessible, quality medication and trusted healthcare support.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <div class="card">
            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-hospital-user"></i> About Us</h2>
            <p>We are dedicated to providing accessible and affordable healthcare support to our local community. Our focus is on delivering high-quality pharmaceutical care, prescription guidance, and health education services.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Our Services</h2>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <div class="service-box">
                    <h3>Quality Medication</h3>
                    <p>Dispensing authentic pharmaceutical products and healthcare supplies.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-box">
                    <h3>Medication Counseling</h3>
                    <p>Expert guidance on dosage, drug usage, and wellness advice.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-box">
                    <h3>Health Education</h3>
                    <p>Community health support and preventive care education.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-address-book"></i> Get In Touch</h2>
            <p>Click any of the buttons below to call directly or send an email:</p>
            
            <div class="contact-buttons">
                <!-- Replace +2348000000000 with your actual phone number -->
                <a href="tel:+2348000000000" class="btn btn-phone">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> Call Phone
                </a>
                
                <!-- Replace your-email@gmail.com with your actual Gmail address -->
                <a href="mailto:your-email@gmail.com" class="btn btn-email">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Send Email
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Community Pharmacy Services. All rights reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
                    
